(text "Plugs into the main board on two 2.54 mm headers. Power pins: 4 per rail, about 3 A each." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 601f4bf3-a15f-4d27-81cf-e750f27fabc4))
(text "eFuse settings: OVP 31.8 V (255k/10k), current limit 6.0 A (3.01k), UVLO default 15.5 V, about 11 ms soft start at 24 V (22 nF)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c1bf7fba-218c-498a-be67-d56b83b45ae1))
(text "MODE open = latch-off after an overload (default). Close JP to GND for auto-retry. SHDN left open (internal pull-up)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cc5fb915-fc69-4263-b9d1-958d2582615d))
(text "PGTH and PGOOD are tied to GND (power-good unused; TI allows PGOOD at GND). FLT and IMON go to the main board." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 73bcd783-8315-4945-8a97-860cd194800f))
(text "Reverse polarity: Q1 blocks it (TI arrangement: Q1 source to IN_SYS, drain to IN, gate to B_GATE; Q2 pulls B_GATE down)." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 31e59158-3f14-47ff-a4be-27f29056508d))
(text "TVS SMCJ51CA: stays off with a 48 V supply plugged in by mistake; the eFuse OVP disconnects the board." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e6183acc-2ccf-4b4f-b80a-ae306aeb3520))
(text "TPS7A4901: +5VA = 1.185 V x (1 + 32.4k/10k) = 5.02 V. 10 nF on NR/SS and across the top resistor (CFF)." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b0946e80-47f5-495f-b752-6e86c17bd637))
